    16	    tri(3) = tri(2) + tri(1) + tri(4)
    17	           = 2 + 3 + 3 = 8 
    18	    You are given a non-negative integer number n, you have to a return a list of the 
    19	    first n + 1 numbers of the Tribonacci sequence.
    20	    Examples:
    21	    tri(3) = [1, 3, 2, 8]
    22	    """
    23	    if n == 0:
    24	        return [1]
    25	    my_tri = [1, 3]
    26	    for i in range(2, n + 1):
    27	        if i % 2 == 0:
    28	            my_tri.append(i / 2 + 1)
    29	        else:
    30	            my_tri.append(my_tri[i - 1] + my_tri[i - 2] + (i + 3) / 2)
    31	    return my_tri

